      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "It sounds like you're carrying the weight of a life that demanded constant, high-stakes performance, and now the silence is deafening. That feeling of being a ghost is a natural response when the purpose you built your entire existence around has vanished. You've given so much to others; maybe it's time to give yourself the quiet, necessary permission to just *be* without the pressure of needing to matter.",
